        examples: ['Situation: Last year I was working at a call center, which received over 3,000 calls a day.', 'Task: My task was to reduce waiting times, which were over 10 minutes.', 'Action: First, I analyzed the most common questions. Then I created a self-service menu with our IT team, who were very supportive.', 'Result: As a result, waiting times dropped to 4 minutes and customer satisfaction rose by 18%.'],
